.\&quot;,\&quot;Waterproof and Durable Design – This servo is waterproof, ensuring it can handle outdoor conditions like rain and mud, providing reliable operation for RC models even in wet environments.\&quot;,\&quot;Metal Gear and Stainless Aluminum Shell – Equipped with metal gears and a durable aluminum shell, the servo offers enhanced strength, protection, and long-lasting performance, making it ideal for demanding applications.\&quot;,\&quot;Programmable and Adjustable – The programmable feature allows for customization, enabling users to adjust the servo&amp;#39;s performance to suit specific needs, ideal for RC hobbyists, robotics, and DIY projects.\&quot;,\&quot;Versatile Use Across Multiple Applications – Compatible with 1/18 scale RC crawlers, cars, planes, boats, and robots, this servo offers versatile and precise control for a variety of model types, enhancing their overall performance.\&quot;],\&quot;links\&quot;:[{\&quot;url\&quot;:\&quot;/HobbyPark-Waterproof-Sub-Micro-Steering-Programmable/dp/B0DTNT63QD\&quot;}],\&quot;productCategory\&quot;:{\&quot;glProductGroup\&quot;:{\&quot;symbol\&quot;:\&quot;gl_toy\&quot;},\&quot;productType\&quot;:\&quot;HOBBIES\&quot;},\&quot;prices\&quot;:{\&quot;mainPrice\&quot;:{\&quot;price\&quot;:{\&quot;currency\&quot;:{\&quot;amount\&quot;:23.97,\&quot;currencyCode\&quot;:\&quot;USD\&quot;,\&quot;displayString\&quot;:\&quot;$23.97\&quot;},\&quot;currencyRange\&quot;:{},\&quot;pricePerUnit\&quot;:{\&quot;baseValueAmount\&quot;:0},\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;SALE\&quot;,\&quot;label\&quot;:\&quot;Price:\&quot;,\&quot;strikethrough\&quot;:false,\&quot;addToCartUrl\&quot;:\&quot;https://www.amazon.com/advertising/atc?ie=UTF8&amp;token=0027151BC4FB3E48364DC3556CF2F38308223585&amp;time=1786679676020&amp;merchantId=A2YXT9869S9BVI&amp;asin=B0DTNT63QD&amp;program=dads&amp;adPrice=23.97&amp;offerListingId=BqC6d4%252BtTiVZrUTxt3tX4b0QbF7D1GQuE6xW7pjPOMrH7DbNhX8WyK8Y59Hv6ZZ8LV4QzSbAHelcFtMZIDNkvR6%252Fn%252Biu8WKKyZ5gUVcQduEf7Efq