                                 <div id="feature-bullets" class="a-section a-spacing-medium a-spacing-top-small">                            <ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini">  <li class="a-spacing-mini"><span class="a-list-item"> It is reliable, operates with 2.4 GHz AFHDS 2A signal, safe and steady and does not interfere with.  </span></li>  <li class="a-spacing-mini"><span class="a-list-item"> Support PPM output, single wire connection flight control, with iBus interface, scalable channel.  </span></li>  <li class="a-spacing-mini"><span class="a-list-item"> Better compatibility, it can be compatible for FS-i4, FS-i6, FS-i6X,FS-i6S,FS-i10 variety of transmitters, reduce your trouble.  </span></li>  <li class="a-spacing-mini"><span class="a-list-item"> 2.4G mode is an improved version of the second generation digital automatic FM system with six channels to provide better signal.  </span></li>  <li class="a-spacing-mini"><span class="a-list-item"> Applicable to aircraft / glider / helicopter, with I-Bus interface and data acquisition interface.  </span></li>  </ul>   <!-- Loading EDP related metadata -->
