t;adLink\&quot; aria-label=\&quot;Click to navigate to product detail page\&quot; style=\&quot;background:transparent url(&amp;quot;https://m.media-amazon.com/images/G/01/d16g/kpw/transparent-1x1.png&amp;quot;) repeat 0 0;bottom:0;cursor:pointer;left:0;position:absolute;right:0;top:0;z-index:2;selectors:[object Object];display:block;width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:auto\&quot; href=\&quot;https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2JMJKSL?aref=bcO17Eh6wx&amp;amp;aaxitk=5a56641567246bc7c8c3264e74055577&amp;amp;language=en_US&amp;amp;pd_rd_plhdr=t&amp;amp;ref=dacx_dp_589212774212374442_577176200249333309\&quot; target=\&quot;_top\&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            \n            &lt;script&gt;\n              document.getElementById(&#39;ad&#39;).setAttribute(&#39;data-script-start&#39;, window.CBCDACXRenderStartTime);\n              if (document &amp;&amp; document.fonts) {\n                try {\n                  document.fonts.ready.then(function () {\n                    document.getElementById(&#39;ad&#39;).setAttribute(&#39;data-font-loaded-time&#39;, performance.now());\n                  });\n                } catch (e) {\n                }\n              }\n            &lt;/script&gt;\n            &lt;div style=\&quot;display: none;\&quot; data-size-str=\&quot;970x250\&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            \n\n            \n            &lt;script src=\&quot;https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41qDlz8InOL.js\&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;\n            &lt;script src=\&quot;https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714+3hZjzaL.js\&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;\n            &lt;script charset=\&quot;UTF-8\&quot; src=\&quot;https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/B17FgO46F6L.js\&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;\n            &lt;script&gt;\n              window.CBCDACXBundleLoadedTime = performance.now();\n              document.getElementById(&#39;ad&#39;).setAttribute(&#39;data-bundle-loaded-time&#39;, window.CBCDACXBundleLoadedTime);\n\n              ReactDOM.hydrate(AdaptiveRenderer.default({\&quot;creativeInformation\&quot;:{\&quot;variation\&quot;:\&quot;shop-now\&quot;,\&quot;headline\&quot;:\&quot;Cooling UV Sun Protection Arm Sleeves\&quot;,\&quot;customImages\&quot;:{\&quot;square\&quot;:null,\&quot;tall\&quot;:null,\&quot;wide\&quot;:null},\&quot;logoImgUrl\&quot;:\&quot;https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/al-na-9d5791cf-3faf/5cd81a49-99dd-4587-abba-d4c5cc00f6fd.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;isPreview\&quot;:false,\&quot;priceInformation\&quot;:{\&quot;price\&quot;:9.99,\&quot;fullPrice\&quot;:null,\&quot;pricePerUnit\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;currencyCode\&quot;:\&quot;USD\&quot;},\&quot;isPrimeEligible\&quot;:true,\&quot;productDescription\&quot;:\&quot;ROXUN Arm Sleeves Cooling UV Sun Protection Sport Compression for Men Women | UPF50,Seamless cover arms,Tattoo-covering,Lightweight &amp; breathable,daily wear,Outdoor work,Basketball Baseball,Mangas\&quot;,\&quot;ratings\&quot;:{\&quot;stars\&quot;:4.4,\&quot;amount\&quot;:13779},\&quot;climatePledgeFriendlyBadge\&quot;:{\&quot;attributeCount\&quot;:3,\&quot;certCount\&quot;:0},\&quot;dealBadge\&quot;:{},\&quot;aapiBrandName\&quot;:\&quot;ROXUN\&quot;,\&quot;ctaText\&quot;:\&quot;shop-now\&quot;,\&quot;productGroupType\&quot;:\&quot;gl_apparel\&quot;,\&quot;resolvedAceiData\&quot;:{\&quot;renderFeatureFlags\&quot;:{},\&quot;renderLogData\&quot;:{\&quot;eligibleSCE\&quot;:[\&quot;acei-bsb\&quot;],\&quot;metrics\&quot;:[]},\&quot;aceiExperimentsToRecord\&quot;:{}},\&quot;asin\&quot;:\&quot;B0C2JMJKSL\&quot;,\&quot;productQnADetails\&quot;:{\&quot;productQnA\&quot;:[{\&quot;question\&quot;:\&quot;Does it use your sweat to keep you cool?\&quot;,\&quot;answer\&quot;:\&quot;The sweat-wicking fabric is designed to cool you down as you heat up — pulling moisture away from your skin to regulate temperature during intense activity. Made from 90% nylon and 10% spandex, the breathable blend works as a second-skin fit that stays comfortable even in extreme heat. Customers also note that dipping the sleeves in water can further enhance the cooling effect.\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;sponsored\&quot;},{\&quot;question\&quot;:\&quot;Does it cover tattoos without overheating?\&quot;,\&quot;answer\&quot;:\&quot;These sleeves are specifically designed for tattoo coverage while keeping you cool, thanks to the sweat-wicking nylon-spandex blend that cools you down as you heat up. The 90% nylon and 10% spandex fabric is super stretchy and breathable, offering a second-skin fit that won&#39;t trap heat. Customers report the sleeves keep arms cool even in extreme conditions, and one noted that dipping them in water enhances the cooling effect further.\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;sponsored\&quot;},{\&quot;question\&quot;:\&quot;Does it really block 98% of harmful UV rays?\&quot;,\&quot;answer\&quot;:\&quot;These sleeves carry a UPF 50+ rating, which means they block over 98% of harmful UVA and UVB rays — making them one of the stronger sun-protection options for outdoor activities. Customers specifically call out their effectiveness on the golf course, where prolonged sun exposure is a real concern. The 90% nylon and 10% spandex blend is what enables both the UV-blocking performance and the breathable, second-skin fit.\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;sponsored\&quot;},{\&quot;question\&quot;:\&quot;Does wetting them boost the cooling?\&quot;,\&quot;answer\&quot;:\&quot;Dipping the sleeves in water does enhance the cooling effect, according to customer experience. This works in tandem with the sweat-wicking fabric, which is designed to cool you down as you heat up — so both sweat and water activate the cooling properties of the 90% nylon and 10% spandex blend.\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;sponsored\&quot;}]},\&quot;productTitleType\&quot;:\&quot;DEFAULT\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;DISPLAY\&quot;,\&quot;productImg\&quot;:{\&quot;url\&quot;:\&quot;https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/al-na-9d5791cf-3faf/167c30cc-2572-47f4-b2e6-a10caf8b