            }));</script>         <h1 id="pqv-title"> Product Summary: DTXMX Flysky FS-iA6B Receiver 6CH for FS-i6 FS-i6X FS-i6S RC Transmitter | 6 Channels 2.4GHz AFHDS2A Radio | PWM/PPM/i-Bus Output </h1>    <p id="pqv-byline">From DTXMX</p>               <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium">  <p id="pqv-ratings" data-target="#averageCustomerReviews_feature_div" class="a-spacing-none">  4.7 out of 5 stars, 56 ratings </p> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-reviews-action" data-pqv-reviews-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-reviews" data-target="#customer-reviews_feature_div" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/DTXMX-FS-iA6B-6Channels-Compatible-Transmitter/dp/B0B5RL8NQL/ref=sr_1_2_sspa?ref=dp_product_quick_view#customer-reviews_feature_div"> Customer reviews </a> </span>   </div>        <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-price"> Price </h2>             <p class="a-spacing-small">              <span class="a-text-bold"> One-time purchase: $17.99 </span>                  </p>                                                              <p class="a-text-italic"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-buybox-action" data-pqv-buybox-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-buybox" data-target="#buybox" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/DTXMX-FS-iA6B-6Channels-Compatible-Transmitter/dp/B0B5RL8NQL/ref=sr_1_2_sspa?ref=dp_product_quick_view#buybox"> Purchasing options </a> </span> </p>                <p class="a-text-italic"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-buying-options-action" data-pqv-buying-options-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-buying-options" data-target="#dynamic-aod-ingress-box" class="a-link-normal aok-hidden" href="https://www.amazon.com/DTXMX-FS-iA6B-6Channels-Compatible-Transmitter/dp/B0B5RL8NQL/ref=sr_1_2_sspa?ref=dp_product_quick_view#dynamic-aod-ingress-box"> Other sellers </a> </span> </p> <p class="a-text-italic"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-unqualified-buybox-action" data-pqv-unqualified-buybox-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-unqualified-buybox" data-target="#unqualifiedBuyBox" class="a-link-normal aok-hidden" href="https://www.amazon.com/DTXMX-FS-iA6B-6Channels-Compatible-Transmitter/dp/B0B5RL8NQL/ref=sr_1_2_sspa?ref=dp_product_quick_view#unqualifiedBuyBox"> Other sellers </a> </span> </p>  </div>         <div id="pqv-feature-bullets" data-target="#featurebullets_feature_div" class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-feature-bullets-heading">About this Item</h2> <ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical">  <li><span class="a-list-item">It is reliable, operates with 2.4 GHz AFHDS 2A signal, safe and steady and does not interfere with.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">Support PPM output, single wire connection flight control, with iBus interface, scalable channel.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">Better compatibility, it can be compatible for FS-i4, FS-i6, FS-i6X,FS-i6S,FS-i10 variety of transmitters, reduce your trouble.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">2.4G mode is an improved version of the second generation digital automatic FM system with six channels to provide better signal.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">Applicable to aircraft / glider / helicopter, with I-Bus interface and data acquisition interface.</span></li>  </ul> </div>           <div id="pqv-description" data-target="#productDescription_feature_div" class="a-section a-spacing-medium">  <h2 id="pqv-description-heading">Product Description</h2>    <div>
                    How to bind with FLYSKY transmitter(fs-i6,fs-i6x)?
 1, Connect the supplied bind cable to the B/VCC port on the receiver.
 2, Insert power into any other port.
 3, Hold the "BIND KEY" while powering on the transmitter to enter bind mode.
 4, Remove the power and bind cable from the receiver. Then connect the power cable to the B/VCC port.
 5, Check the servos' operation. If anything does not work as expected, restart this procedure from the beginning.

 FS-IA6B Specification:
 Item Name: FS-iA6B
 Channel: 6
 Frequency Range: 2.4055--2.475GHZ
 brand Width Number: 140
 Transmitting Power: ≤ 20dBm
 RF Receiver Sensitivity: -105dbm
 2.4G Mode: The second generation of an enhanced version of the automatic FM digital system
 Encoding: GFSK
 Antenna Length: 26mm * 2 (dual antenna)
 Input Power: 4.0-8.5V DC
 Dimension: 47 x 26.2 x 15mm
 Weight: 14.9g
 i-Bus /PPM/PWM Interface: Yes
 Data Acquisition Interface: Yes
 Model Type: Airplane / Glider / Helicopter

 Package Included:
 1x Flysky fs-ia6b receiver
 1x Bind plug
  </div>
               </div>                                    <div id="pqv-important-information" data-target="#importantInformation_feature_div" class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-important-information-heading">Important Information</h2>     <h3>Toy Safety</h3>   <p></p><ol class="a-ordered-list a-vertical"><li><span class="a-list-item">Our recommended age:  </span></li><li><span class="a-list-item">Manufacturer's minimum age: 15 years  </span></li><li><span class="a-list-item"> </span></li></ol><p></p>    </div>                  <div class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-report-issue-action" data-pqv-report-issue-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-report-issue" data-target="#tellAmazon_feature_div" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/DTXMX-FS-iA6B-6Channels-Compatible-Transmitter/dp/B0B5RL8NQL/ref=sr_1_2_sspa?ref=dp_product_quick_view#tellAmazon_feature_div"> Report an issue with this product or seller </a> </span> </div>                     <div id="pqv-feedback" class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-feedback-heading">Feedback</h2> <p>Did you find this product summary feature useful?</p>   <div id="pqv-feedback-buttons-section" class="a-section"> <div class="a-section a-padding-base aok-float-left"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-feedback-positive-action" data-pqv-feedback-positive-action="{}"> <span id="pqv-feedback-positive" class="a-button a-button-base"><span class="a-button-inner"><input id="pqv-feedback-positive-native" aria-described-by="Submit feedback that this product summary is useful" class="a-button-input" type="submit" aria-labelledby="pqv-feedback-positive-announce"><span id="pqv-feedback-positive-announce" class="a-button-text" aria-hidden="true"> Yes, it is useful </span></span></span> </span> </div> <div class="a-section a-padding-base"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-feedback-negative-action" data-pqv-feedback-negative-action="{}"> <span id="pqv-feedbac